  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trust-building in the Sahel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to strengthen and re-establish contact,  to restore trust between the justice system, the security forces (both national / local and the Joint Force) , and populations , to prevent associations with terrorist and criminal groups, and to facilitate the involvement of the population in the fight against these groups.</narrative>
  </description>
